graph TD
    Start[Start Script Generation Node] --> OSDetectionCheck{OS Type}
    
    OSDetectionCheck -->|Windows| WinAttemptCheck{Current Attempt?}
    OSDetectionCheck -->|Linux/macOS| LinAttemptCheck{Current Attempt?}
    
    WinAttemptCheck -->|Attempt 1 or 2| PS1[Generate PowerShell .ps1]
    WinAttemptCheck -->|Attempt 3| PyWin[Generate Python .py]
    
    LinAttemptCheck -->|Attempt 1 or 2| PyLin[Generate Python .py]
    LinAttemptCheck -->|Attempt 3| Bash[Generate Bash .sh]
    
    PS1 --> LLM[LLMService Generation]
    PyWin --> LLM
    PyLin --> LLM
    Bash --> LLM
    
    LLM --> Validation{Validation}
    Validation -->|Secrets detected or syntax error| RetryLLM{Retry allowed?}
    RetryLLM -->|Yes| LLM
    RetryLLM -->|No| FailScript[Mark FAILED]
    
    Validation -->|Success| RiskAnalysis[Risk Analysis Node]
    
    RiskAnalysis --> RiskCheck{Risk Score}
    RiskCheck -->|HIGH| Blocked[BLOCKED_HIGH_RISK]
    RiskCheck -->|LOW/MEDIUM| FleetExecution[Fleet Execution Node]
    
    FleetExecution --> Upload[Upload Script to FleetDM]
    Upload --> Run[Execute Script via FleetDM API]
    Run --> ExecID[Get Execution ID]
    
    ExecID --> Monitoring[Monitoring Node]
    Monitoring --> Poll[Poll FleetDM Execution Status]
    
    Poll --> ExitCode{Exit Code?}
    ExitCode -->|0| Success[Mark COMPLETED]
    ExitCode -->|!= 0 or Timeout| FailExecution[Mark FAILED]
    
    Success --> Cleanup[Installation Script Cleanup Node]
    FailExecution --> Cleanup
    Blocked --> Cleanup
    FailScript --> Cleanup
    
    Cleanup --> DeleteScript[Delete FleetDM Script]
    DeleteScript --> ScriptFailureAnalysis[Script Failure Analysis Node]
    
    ScriptFailureAnalysis --> CheckStatus{Status?}
    CheckStatus -->|FAILED| RetryCheck{Max Retries Exceeded?}
    CheckStatus -->|COMPLETED| Verif[Verification Flow]
    
    RetryCheck -->|No| TriggerRegen[Trigger Regeneration]
    TriggerRegen --> Start
    
    RetryCheck -->|Yes| Notification[Notification Node]
